{"id":"10A","title":"Murder","part":{"n":10,"title":"Capital laws & offenses"},"url":"/law/10-capital-laws-offenses/10a","entries":[{"id":"10A.1","text":"Thou shall not murder.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":20,"verses":"13"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":5,"verses":"17"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":5,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":19,"verses":"18"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":13,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"Exod. 20:13; Deut 5:17; Matt. 5:2; Matt. 19:18; Rom. 13:9."},{"id":"10A.2","text":"Shedding of innocent blood is an abomination to God.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":6,"verses":"16-17"}],"citation":"Prov. 6:16-17."},{"id":"10A.3","text":"God requires the blood of a murderer for it defiles the land.","refs":[{"book":"Genesis","chapter":9,"verses":"5-6"},{"book":"Numbers","chapter":35,"verses":"33"}],"citation":"Gen. 9:5-6; Num. 35:33."},{"id":"10A.4","text":"Those guilty of murder are to be put to death.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":24,"verses":"17,21"},{"book":"Numbers","chapter":35,"verses":"16,21,30-31"}],"citation":"Lev. 24:17, 21; Num. 35:16, 21, 30-31."},{"id":"10A.5","text":"If a man acts with premeditation against his neighbor, to kill him with guile, he shall die.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":21,"verses":"14"}],"citation":"Exod. 21:14."},{"id":"10A.6","text":"One who strikes a man so that he dies is a murderer and shall be put to death.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":21,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Numbers","chapter":35,"verses":"16-18"}],"citation":"Exod. 21:12; Num. 35:16-18."},{"id":"10A.7","text":"Killing for hire is condemned (the assassin and the one who hires him are both guilty of murder).","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":27,"verses":"25"},{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":22,"verses":"12"}],"citation":"Deut 27:25; Ezek. 22:12."},{"id":"10A.8","text":"You are not to act against the life of your neighbor.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"16"}],"citation":"Lev. 19: 16."},{"id":"10A.9","text":"The law concerning unsolved murders.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":21,"verses":"1-9"}],"citation":"Deut. 21:1-9."}]}